# The sweep of path_sweep_corner with its frames held to y on the
# group's screen, mitred at its corner though fitted; the same as
# path_sweep_held_corner.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/sweep_held_corner).
file $testdata/ui/sweep_corner.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view other
click-entity 40000
click-entity 50000
menu Features|Sweep Along Path
click-tw y
